{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-23T09:04:38.363Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"ea075d0f0b1045c22392bd5c","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-23T09:04:38.363Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Implementation: directory reader is injectable per call; real child read/stat failures ENOENT or ENOTDIR skip only that child. Root directory reads stay outside the child guard. EACCES, EIO and unexpected errors propagate unchanged. A final no-follow leaf stat omits vanished or type-replaced entries. Installation runtime is non-negatable and pruned in both tracker discovery and working-tree enumeration; ordinary runtime-fence exceptions still remain discoverable. Positive verification: 60 focused walk/ignore/control tests passed, including 13 new regressions; 3 raw-coverage/inventory boundary tests passed. Native staging ran in a real SDK-initialized non-git tracker with an empty executable search path. Runtime cannot be explicitly staged or materialized, visible legacy runtime index entries are removed on add, and global settings remain eligible. Source build, typecheck, test typecheck, lint, 0% duplication and docstrings passed; production inventory stays 76 files."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-23T09:04:38.363Z"}],"before_hash":"49703c71027b0a4b4513a195ff84d6696c71d7d82582a39c30b5c24485f3c575","after_hash":"c9c568b80c04f117c8b6ccde1a9ecf58c47624a573b6b2c97f05b5f5dc14c08d","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"u